 ("Which visa is right for me?","It depends on why you are coming, how long you want to stay and your nationality. Book a free call and we will tell you which options fit before you pay anything."),
 ("Can I extend my visa without leaving Vietnam?","Some visa types can be extended in-country and others cannot. We check your current visa and tell you the safest route."),
 ("What happens if I overstay?","Overstays can lead to fines and problems with future applications. Contact us as soon as possible and we will explain your options."),
 ("Who qualifies for a Temporary Residence Card?","Usually people with a work permit, an investment in a Vietnamese company, or a close family link to a Vietnamese citizen or TRC holder."),
 ("How long does a residence card take?","Most applications take a few weeks once all documents are ready. Document preparation is usually the longest part."),
 ("Can my family be included?","Yes. Spouses and children can usually apply as dependents. We handle their applications alongside yours."),
 ("Do I need to legalise my documents?","Many documents from abroad, such as degrees and criminal record checks, must be legalised before they are accepted. We tell you exactly which ones."),
 ("Can you help me open a company?","Yes. We handle company registration, licences and the investor visa or residence card that goes with it."),
 ("What if my application is rejected?","We review the reason, fix what is missing and resubmit. Our packages include handling of follow-up requests from the office."),
